.TH UNIXTERM 1 "December 6, 2006" "Virtual Distributed Ethernet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
unixterm \- (simple) Remote terminal for unix sockets
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B unixterm 
.I socket  
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A
\fBunixterm\fP 
is a terminal application for a unix stream socket.

It has been created as a part of the vde-2 project: it is used as a remote 
console for vde_switch or for the wirefilter application.
.SH NOTICE
Virtual Distributed Ethernet is not related in any way with
www.vde.com ("Verband der Elektrotechnik, Elektronik und Informationstechnik"
i.e. the German "Association for Electrical, Electronic & Information
Technologies").

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBvde_switch\fP(1),
\fBwirefilter\fP(1).
.br
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
VDE is a project by Renzo Davoli <renzo@cs.unibo.it>
